From 4ce9d7a568b24b581f32d7b4cedf9c28265f8eb0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:17:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge branch 'partners-npc-b' into integration

Conflicts resolved keeping both branches:
- per-partner rows (EVOLUTION_REQS, EVOLUTION_STATS_GAINS, RAISE_DATA,
  ITEM_TAKE_DISTANCE, VLALL, TRN/TRN2 ids): both sets of rows;
- adjacent rows 119/120 of CONDITION_FX_OFFSETS, VBALL and the three aura
  projectile tables: ShogunGekomon's and King of Sukamon's;
- ids.h: one HAS_RAISED_FLAG with King of Sukamon and the npc-b partners,
  RAISED_TRIGGER kept;
- mod_lab.c: one evolve list, count from the array;
- efe.c: npc-a's MOD_TECH_DONORS and npc-b's modBorrowTechOffset (and
  Cherrymon's Piximon code) unified into one MOD_TECH_DONORS table read by
  getModDonorTechBoneOffset.

